## Kravtext (engelskt original)

### 03.02.01 – Literacy Training and Awareness

- SR-03.02.01.a Provide security literacy training to system users:
  - SR-03.02.01.a.01 As part of initial training for new users and [organization-defined frequency] thereafter,
  - SR-03.02.01.a.02 When required by system changes or following [organization-defined events], and
  - SR-03.02.01.a.03 On recognizing and reporting indicators of insider threat, social engineering, and social mining.
- SR-03.02.01.b Update security literacy training content [organization-defined frequency] and following [organization-defined events].

### 03.02.02 – Role-Based Training

- SR-03.02.02.a Provide role-based security training to organizational personnel:
  - SR-03.02.02.a.01 Before authorizing access to the system or CUI, before performing assigned duties, and [organization-defined frequency] thereafter
  - SR-03.02.02.a.02 When required by system changes or following [organization-defined events].
- SR-03.02.02.b Update role-based training content [organization-defined frequency] and following [organization-defined events].

